# Arsenal agent context

## Read first

- Vocabulary: `CONTEXT.md`
- Surfaces and Foundry systems: `docs/internal/system/system-overview.md` (local only; may be missing on a fresh clone)
- Stage inventory: `api/app/pipeline.py`

## Names

Use Foundry, Academy, Library, Intellex, Mathesys, QnGen as defined in `CONTEXT.md` and the system overview. Do not call Foundry a CMS, Academy an LMS, or Intellex "Library."

## Ownership

- Wiki entries → Intellex
- File artifacts (ebook, narration, study material, wiki JSON snapshot) → Mathesys
- Assessments (flashcards, quizzes, scenarios) → QnGen

Do not stuff wiki into Mathesys or assessments into the artifact catalog.

## Verify

- `cd app && npm run lint`
- `cd app && npm test`
- `cd api && python -m pytest tests/`

Prefer lint rules and tests over new prose when correcting repeated agent mistakes.
